Use only elements already visible in the dynamic scope and avoid parent->child hops in a single step. Define both `api_container` and `auth_component` as model elements, then show valid interactions in sequence.

```likec4
model {
  system api_container 'API Container'
  component auth_component 'Auth Component'

  api_container -> auth_component 'Delegates authentication'
}

views {
  dynamic auth_flow {
    title 'Authentication Flow'

    api_container -> auth_component 'Validate token'
    auth_component -> api_container 'Auth decision'
  }
}
```

If your DSL variant requires hierarchical IDs, keep them as separate elements and reference their declared names/aliases directly in the dynamic view.
